    watch: "Whether the Venezuela oil deal survives the 'acting president' instability it's built on; whether Iran's blockade-for-blockade standoff with the US breaks the diplomatic logjam now that a shipping route is actually agreed; and whether the Nabatieh escalation risks unraveling the June Lebanon ceasefire the way the Aug 15 strikes nearly did.",
